              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "stephaniestennes"
            },
            "reviewBody": "so my dad came home with a bunch of fresh albacore tuna and i had no idea what to do with it. this was a great starter. i marinated it in the olive oil for an hour and then cut it into little pieces (about 3 inches) and seasoned them with salt and garlic pepper. and then drizzled with fresh squeezed lime juice. it was amazing!",
            "datePublished": "2008-09-14T21:30:44.887Z"
